  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I'm genuily concerned rn, the situation is getting worse and worse. And I only face deception in terms of how things are put in place about reports. I told several times issues about it. Rn, groups are being more and more toxic, literally abusing their tools and kicking people all around like toys. Reporting them is impossible, since tickets made on website \"without evidence\" are \"closed automatically\" (when it's impossible to get evidences and anyone can fake them), and reports ingame are taken only during certain time, and first in last out. Even vrchat bot agrees there is a problem about this. I'm honestly concerned about the future of vrchat. How do you expect to handle toxicity in July ?",
